-- Ulduar (603): undo the world DB part of #207 (Legends of Azeroth scripts), before upstream SkyFire's Ulduar SQL runs.
-- The scripts are now upstream SkyFire's (TrinityCore 3.3.5 Thorim and Mimiron, sardi-dev's pr/ulduar-* branches).
-- #207's file (2026_11_23_world_custom_18) changed bindings, texts, achievement criteria data, conditions, linked
-- spells, template flags and added 127 spawns (9688000-9688126). This file puts every row it touched back as it was
-- before #207, taken from the world_dev dump of 2026-11-15: each of its DELETEs is repeated and followed by the old
-- rows, and each column it updated gets its old value back. Generated by skyfire_port_plan/tools/gen_revert.py.
-- Named to sort before upstream's Ulduar files, which expect this state. Safe to run twice.

